  "data": {
    "summary": "**[[SUSTAINED HITS 2]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** counts only when this attack targets a unit with neither **MONSTER** nor **VEHICLE**. If even one model in the target unit has either keyword, the whole unit [counts as having it](vsdata:core-rule/keywords), so the ability does nothing. Otherwise each critical hit scores 2 extra hits on the target, so that attack hits it three times in total.",
